# Runtime output (per TESTS.md §0 — never commit)
reports/
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
~/.mentar/
# The learner DB's SIDECARS and BACKUPS. `*.db` does NOT match any of these --
# they end in "-wal" / "-shm" / ".backup-<timestamp>", not ".db" (found
# 2026-08-18 by running `mentar backup`, which left an untracked, unignored
# copy of the learner DB in the repo root: its documented default destination).
#
# These hold the same child data as the DB itself -- verbatim transcripts and
# escalation disclosures -- so they are the LAST thing that may reach a repo
# that is planned to go public. The DB runs in WAL mode, so the -wal/-shm pair
# exists whenever the app is running: a `git add -A` from a second terminal
# while a lesson is open would have staged them.
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.db.backup-*
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm

# Eval data (large; pinned via dataset version hash, not committed wholesale)
eval/responses/
eval/dataset_*.jsonl
eval/scores_*.csv

